  "system": {
    "description": "<p>You conjure a barrier of wind to shield against attacks.</p><p>Select a creature within <strong>10 spaces</strong>. It increases its <strong>Defense</strong> by <strong>+1</strong> until the start of your turn.</p><p>If the creature is struck by an attack, it may choose to end the effect early to negate the attack.</p><p>Each extra success extends the duration by <strong>+1 rounds</strong>.</p><p>Alternatively, you may select another creature to affect or increase the bonus to <strong>Defense</strong> by <strong>+1</strong> per extra success.</p><p>You may spend <strong>1 Resolve</strong> to immediately cast this spell on another creature's turn.</p><p><strong>Effect:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.titan-vttrpg-compendium.effects.ActiveEffect.6PIqDDpkpqoCmNVc]{Wind Ward}</p>",
